11.\r\n\r\nGenerating the templates works, `generate_apk=yes` fails pretty late in the gradle part with:\r\n`\\godot\\platform\\android\\java\\lib\\build\\generated\\aidl_source_output_dir\\templateDebug\\out\\com\\android\\vending\\licensing\\ILicenseResultListener.java:3: error: illegal unicode escape` a bunch of times.\r\n\r\nAccording to [StackOverflow](https://stackoverflow.com/a/79767269), this is a bug in the Android `35.0.0` build tools (*maybe* specific to Windows on specific install paths) which apparently build tools version `35.0.1` fixed.\r\n\r\nBumping `buildTools` to `35.0.1` in `platform/android/java/app/config.gradle` fixes the issue for me. I found no other mention of `35.0.0` (outside the docs repo, which we need to update once this is merged; I can take care of that).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v